给我一些暗示</text><text for="L48">因为</text><text for="L49">有什么事情不太对劲</text><text for="L50">我一直在仔细倾听</text><text for="L51">全神贯注</text><text for="L52">而你没有在听</text><text for="L53">你一直在白白浪费</text><text for="L54">肆意挥霍</text><text for="L55">你的时间都用来撒谎</text><text for="L56">Oh oh oh</text><text for="L57">Yeah yeah</text><text for="L58">你就像药剂</text><text for="L59">药剂</text><text for="L60">Yeah</text><text for="L61">Yeah</text><text for="L62">毒害我的大脑</text><text for="L63">药剂</text><text for="L64">Hey</text><text for="L65">Hey hey yeah</text><text for="L66">你就像药剂</text><text for="L67">药剂</text><text for="L68">药剂</text><text for="L69">毒害我的大脑</text><text for="L70">药剂</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body><div itunes:song-part="Verse"><p begin="0:10.894" end="0:12.696" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:10.894" end="0:11.496">One</span> <span begin="0:12.039" end="0:12.696">more</span></p><p begin="0:13.400" end="0:15.400" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:13.400" end="0:14.568">Shot</span> <span begin="0:14.568" end="0:15.400">'cause</span></p><p begin="0:16.088" end="0:18.577" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:16.088" end="0:16.392">I</span> <span begin="0:16.392" end="0:16.680">feel</span> <span begin="0:16.680" end="0:16.952">like</span> <span begin="0:16.952" end="0:17.489">you're</span> <span begin="0:17.489" end="0:17.697">up</span> <span begin="0:17.697" end="0:17.968">to</span> <span begin="0:17.968" end="0:18.577">somethin'</span></p><p begin="0:19.147" end="0:19.628" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:19.147" end="0:19.324">****</span> <span begin="0:19.324" end="0:19.628">that</span></p><p begin="0:19.821" end="0:21.310" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:19.821" end="0:20.108">You're</span> <span begin="0:20.108" end="0:20.316">up</span> <span begin="0:20.316" end="0:20.668">to</span> <span begin="0:20.668" end="0:21.310">somethin'</span></p><p begin="0:22.733" end="0:24.093" it